00147| ## 4. HTTP API (nexus-server, axum; serves webui/dist as static root)
00148| 
00149| All under `/api`. Errors: `{"error": "..."}` with 4xx/5xx. Success bodies as
00150| specified. Long ops → tasks. Global SSE bus at `GET /api/events` emits JSON
00151| lines: `{"type":"case_updated|task_update|entity_added","case_id":...,...}`.
00152| 
00153| ### Cases / graph
00154| - `GET  /api/health` → `{"ok":true,"version":"0.1.0","connectors":{"hub":"up","flowsint":"unset","openplanter":"down","archon":"up","laya":"unset"}}`
00155| - `GET  /api/cases` → `{"cases":[Case...]}`
00156| - `POST /api/cases` `{name, notes?, tags?}` → 201 `{"case":Case}`
00157| - `GET  /api/cases/{id}` → `{"case":Case,"stats":{"entities":N,"relations":N,"evidence":N,"tasks":N}}`
00158| - `PATCH /api/cases/{id}` `{status?, notes?}` → `{"case":Case}`
00159| - `DELETE /api/cases/{id}` → `{"ok":true}`
00160| - `GET  /api/cases/{id}/graph` → `{"nodes":[Entity...],"edges":[Relation...],
00161|      "analysis":{"degree":{},"pagerank":{},"communities":{},"components":[[...]]}}`
00162| - `GET  /api/cases/{id}/path?a=e_1&b=e_2` → `{"path":[ids] | null}`
00163| - `GET  /api/cases/{id}/pivots?entity=e_1` → `{"pivots":[PivotSuggestion...]}`
00164| 
00165| ### Entities / relations / evidence / timeline / docs
00166| - `POST /api/cases/{id}/entities` `{etype,label,data?,confidence?}` → 201 `{"entity":Entity,"deduplicated":bool}`
00167| - `GET  /api/entities/{id}` → `{"entity":E,"relations":[R...],"evidence":[V...],"doc":str|null}`
00168| - `PATCH /api/entities/{id}` `{label?,data?,pinned?,confidence?}` → `{"entity":E}`
00169| - `DELETE /api/entities/{id}` → `{"ok":true}`
00170| - `POST /api/entities/{id}/merge` `{other:"e_2"}` → `{"entity":E}`
00171| - `POST /api/relations` `{case_id,src,dst,rel,weight?,confidence?,source?,evidence?}` → 201 `{"relation":R}`
00172| - `DELETE /api/relations/{id}` → `{"ok":true}`
00173| - `POST /api/evidence` `{case_id,subject,kind,title?,url?,snippet?,raw?,confidence?}` → 201 `{"evidence":V}`
00174| - `GET  /api/entities/{id}/evidence` → `{"evidence":[V...]}`
00175| - `GET  /api/cases/{id}/timeline` → `{"events":[K...]}`
00176| - `POST /api/cases/{id}/timeline` `{ts?,entity_id?,kind,title,detail?,source?}` → 201 `{"event":K}`
00177| - `GET  /api/entities/{id}/doc` → `{"doc":str}`
00178| - `PATCH /api/entities/{id}/doc` `{markdown}` → `{"doc":str}`
00179| - `POST /api/entities/{id}/doc/render` → `{"doc":str}`
00180| 
00181| ### Tasks (async connector runs)
00182| - `POST /api/cases/{id}/tasks` `{kind, target?, params?}` → 202 `{"task":T}`
00183|   - `hub_scan` — params `{scan:"username|phone|email|image", value?}` (value
00184|     defaults to target entity label). Runs hub multi-scan, ingests every hit
00185|     as entity + relation (`uses`/`resolves_to`) + evidence + timeline.
00186|   - `flowsint_enrich` — params `{enrichers:["subdomain_discovery",...]}` on
00187|     target entity; ingests produced nodes/edges.
00188|   - `openplanter_research` — params `{question}`. Spawns CLI agent in the
00189|     case workspace; ingests artifacts as documents/evidence + extracted
00190|     entities (email/phone/domain/ip/wallet/username regex sweep).
00191|   - `archon_ground` — params `{question, sandbox?, top_k?}`. Ask archon,
00192|     attach answer+citations as evidence + doc "Sources" + timeline.
00193|   - `web_pivots` — params `{}` → builds search-launcher set for target,
00194|     stored as note entity data + timeline.
00195| - `GET  /api/tasks?case_id=` → `{"tasks":[T...]}` (newest first, cap 100)
00196| - `GET  /api/tasks/{id}` → `{"task":T}`
00197| - `GET  /api/tasks/{id}/stream` → SSE `{"task_id","level","msg","ts"}` lines
00198| Task JSON: `{"id":"t_1","case_id":"c_1","kind":"hub_scan","status":"queued|running|done|error","target":null,"params":{},"created_at":...,"finished_at":null,"summary":"14 sites hit","ingested":{"entities":12,"relations":14,"evidence":14},"logs":[...]}`
00199| 
00200| ### Reports / interchange / laya / archon
00201| - `GET /api/cases/{id}/dossier.md` → text/markdown
00202| - `GET /api/cases/{id}/brief.md` → text/markdown
00203| - `GET /api/cases/{id}/export.json` → full case (nodes, edges, evidence, timeline, docs)
00204| - `POST /api/cases/import` — accepts nexus export.json shape → 201 new case
00205| - `POST /api/laya/triage` `{case_id}` → `{"ranked":[{"entity_id","score","verdict","reason"}...],"engine":"laya|heuristic"}`
00206| - `GET  /api/archon/status` → `{"up":bool,"sandboxes":[...]}` (empty list when down)
00207| - `POST /api/archon/ask` `{question, case_id?, sandbox?, top_k?}` → `{"ok":true,"answer","citations":[...],"evidence":V}` (evidence attached when case_id given)
00208| - `POST /api/archon/push_case` `{case_id, sandbox?}` → creates/refreshes sandbox
00209|   named `nexus-<slug>`, pushes dossier.md as canon doc → `{"ok":true,"sandbox":{...}}`
00210| 
00211| ### Server bootstrap (nexus-server lib — REQUIRED signature for tauri)
00212| ```rust
00213| pub struct Config { pub db_path: PathBuf, pub hub_url: String, pub hub_token: Option<String>,
00214|     pub flowsint_url: Option<String>, pub openplanter_bin: Option<String>,
00215|     pub workspaces: PathBuf, pub archon_url: String, pub laya_url: Option<String>,
00216|     pub laya_log: Option<PathBuf>, pub web_dist: Option<PathBuf> }
00217| impl Config { pub fn from_env() -> Self }
00218| pub struct AppState { /* core Store + config + task engine + bus */ }
00219| pub async fn init_state(cfg: Config) -> AppState;
00220| pub fn build_router(state: AppState) -> axum::Router; // static UI mounted LAST (fallback "/" -> index.html)
00221| pub async fn serve(cfg: Config) -> anyhow::Result<()>; // bind 127.0.0.1:NEXUS_PORT, convenience for CLI
00222| ```
