00224| ## 5. Connector contracts (nexus-server/connectors/)
00225| 
00226| - **hub.rs** — `POST {NEXUS_HUB_URL}/api/scan` `{type:"multi",value,tools:[...],options:{}}`
00227|   w/ `Authorization: Bearer <redacted> (omit when unset) → 202
00228|   `{job_id}`; poll `GET /api/jobs/{id}` every 2s until `status` ∈
00229|   `done|error` (timeout 15min). Job snapshot shape:
00230|   `{id,status,created,finished,results:[{qtype,tool,status,found:[{site,url}],info:[{k,v}],error}...],events:[...]}`.
00231|   Digest → per hit: entity(etype by qtype: username/phone/email) + relation
00232|   to the scanned target (`uses`) + evidence{tool_result,url,site}.
00233| - **flowsint.rs** — base `FLOWSINT_URL`. `up` = `GET {base}/api/health`
00234|   responds ok (any 2xx). Enricher run: `POST {base}/api/enrichers/run`
00235|   `{type, value, enricher}` — VERIFY exact route/shape against flowsint docs
00236|   (https://github.com/reconurge/flowsint/tree/main/docs) at build time; if
00237|   the API differs, adapt here and note in `nexus/docs/INTEGRATIONS.md`.
00238|   Ingest: map returned nodes to nexus etypes (their Domain/IP/ASN/CIDR/
00239|   Individual/Organization/Email/Phone/Website/Social/Credentials/Wallet set),
00240|   edges to canonical rels, keep provenance `flowsint:<enricher>`.
00241| - **openplanter.rs** — run `{bin} --task {question} --workspace {dir}
00242|   --headless --no-tui` (add `--provider ollama` when
00243|   `OPENPLANTER_PROVIDER=ollama`), cwd = fresh per-task dir under
00244|   `OPENPLANTER_WORKSPACES/<case_slug>/<task_id>/`, kill after 20min. After
00245|   exit: walk dir for files written during run (md/txt/json/csv, <2MB);
00246|   each → evidence{kind:openplanter_finding} + document entity; regex-sweep
00247|   text for emails/phones/domains/ips/usernames/wallets → candidate entities
00248|   linked `derived_from` the task document. stdout tail → task logs.
00249| - **archon.rs** — exact shapes from tulpa pillars.py (verified 2026-09):
00250|   `GET  {ARCHON_URL}/api/sandboxes` → 200 list[{id,name,library_id}]
00251|   `POST {ARCHON_URL}/api/sandboxes` `{"name":...}` → 200/201 {id,...}
00252|   `POST {ARCHON_URL}/api/ask` `{"question","sandbox_id"?,"libraries"?,"top_k"?}`
00253|     → 200 `{answer,citations,libraries_searched,backend,found}`
00254|   Down/unreachable → `{"ok":false,"detail"}`; NEVER hard-fail a case op on
00255|   archon being down (degrade, mirror tulpa behavior).
00256| - **laya.rs** — when `LAYA_URL` set: `POST {LAYA_URL}/predict`
00257|   `{domain:"osint-grading", state, questions}` (typed decision; triage
00258|   question set: `{"lead_value": {"type":"score", ...}}`) — tolerate failure →
00259|   heuristic. Heuristic scorer: pinned boost, etype weights
00260|   (person>username>email>phone>domain>ip>other), evidence-count log boost,
00261|   connector-availability boost. Log every decision (engine, inputs, output)
00262|   JSONL to `NEXUS_LAYA_LOG` when set → feeds future `nexus-triage` fine-tune.
00263| - **websearch.rs** — pure URL builders (no scraping): google/ddg/bing/news/
00264|   wikipedia/reddit/youtube + site: dorks per etype + username guesses.
00265| 
00266| ## 6. Web UI (webui/ — Vite + TypeScript + Cytoscape.js)
00267| 
00268| - `npm run build` → `webui/dist/` (server serves it; tauri webview loads server URL).
00269| - Stack: vite + typescript, cytoscape + cytoscape-fcose (dagre/cose fallback
00270|   if fcose troublesome), no CSS framework — hand-rolled, matching the hub's
00271|   "steddi engineering-drawing" aesthetic: dark blueprint grid bg, film grain,
00272|   mono type (ui-monospace stack), 1px hairlines, purple accent #a78bfa,
00273|   amber warnings; panels with corner ticks. Zero external runtime requests.
00274| - Panes: left case rail (cases, connector health dots, new case); center
00275|   graph canvas (etype color map, label+, click select, shift-click = path
00276|   mode A→B, search + type filter chips, layout buttons force/grid/circle);
00277|   right inspector drawer (entity fields, relations list, evidence list,
00278|   wiki doc editor w/ render button, action buttons: hub scan / flowsint
00279|   enrich / openplanter research / archon ground / pivots); bottom console
00280|   (tasks + SSE logs); top bar (case name, tabs Graph|Timeline|Analysis|Story,
00281|   settings gear). Analysis tab: centrality+pagerank tables, communities,
00282|   pivot suggestion cards w/ one-click run. Story tab: dossier.md + brief.md
00283|   rendered (tiny in-house md renderer), copy/download, "push to archon".
00284| - Settings modal writes to `localStorage: nexus_settings` `{hub_url,hub_token,
00285|   flowsint_url,openplanter_bin,archon_url,laya_url}` → `POST /api/admin/config`
00286|   (server merges runtime-overridable connector settings; env stays default).
00287|   → so ADD `POST /api/admin/config` accepting a partial Config JSON (subset
00288|   fields above, db path NOT overridable), returns effective redacted config.
00289| - All fetches via `api()` wrapper (same-origin `/api`).
