00291| ## 7. Tauri shell (nexus-tauri)
00292| 
00293| Tauri 2, app id `com.qalarc.nexus`, window 1440x900 min 1100x700, title
00294| "NEXUS — qalarc investigation workbench". `main.rs` (tokio runtime):
00295| `init_state(Config::from_env())` → bind `127.0.0.1:0` via
00296| `axum::serve` on `build_router(state)` → get port → open WebviewWindow at
00297| `http://127.0.0.1:{port}`. `tauri.conf.json` frontendDist points to a
00298| placeholder (`src/`) since UI is server-served; devUrl unused. Cargo deps:
00299| `tauri = { version = "2", features = [] }`, `tokio`, `nexus-server` (path).
00300| Build: `cargo build -p nexus-tauri` (CLI `nexus-tauri` runs server-only with
00301| `--headless` flag printing the URL — usable without webview libs).
00302| Provide `nexus/crates/nexus-tauri/README.md` with `cargo tauri` dev/build
00303| instructions (npx @tauri-apps/cli).
00304| 
